title: square_initial
---
	Josh: What's up Elder Amos?
	Elder Amos: Hmm, fine, fine indeed. I'm fine, yes. How about you, young one?
	Josh: I'm good. Kind of a misty day, don't you think?
	Elder Amos: Yes, the mist. The mist is strong. I- very good. 
	-> Uh... what's very good?
		Josh: Uh... what's very good?
		Elder Amos: Yes, indeed. Very good.
	-> Yup. Very good...?
		Josh: Yup. Very good...?
		Elder Amos: The mist. Very good. It's strong. Very good.
	Josh: Ok... good talk, I guess.
	Josh: ... I swear this geezer wasn't as weird a few days ago.
===

title: not_talked_friends
---
Josh: Hmm... Maybe I should go see my friends before heading home. We haven't talked in a bit.
<<progress NotTalkedFriendsYet>>
===

title: square_marcus_erika
---
Marcus: What's up Joshy?
Josh: 'Sup.
Erika: Wow, look who's in a good mood today.
Josh: Yup, brimmin' with joy.
Marcus: Ah, come on Joshy it's a beautiful day! Everyone's having fun, doing their things... a little misty, but beautiful anyway.
Josh: You have a weird concept of beauty. Anyway... have you talked to elder Amos? He seems to be out of it.
Marcus: Ah, old man's always been like this, nothing new.
Josh: I don't know man, he seems worse.
Erika: Screw that fossil, what are we doing today?
Josh: I'm heading home I guess.
Marcus: Come on Joshy, you know I don't have much time...
Josh: He's really leaving, then.
Erika: Don't be a shut in for once, Josh.
Josh: Ok ok. I'll just relax for a bit, and I'll meet you.
Marcus: Nice, okay.
Erika: We meet here in an hour-ish.
Josh: 'Kay.
<<progress TalkedFriends>>
===

title: home_outside_first
---
Josh: What's this?! (noise?)
... 
Haze: Hm... Hello sir.
Josh: Wha—who—what are you?
Haze: Hmm... a fine question indeed. One I don't know the answer to.
Josh: Okay..? And what are you doing here?
Haze: Hmm... a fine question indeed. One i don—
Josh: Okay just—stop. Come inside or else you'll freak people out.
Haze: Why would I freak them out?
Josh: Cause you're a talking smoke?
Haze: I... am?
Josh: Pretty much, yeah.
Haze: And you're not freaked out?
Josh: You don't seem hostile.
Haze: I don't feel hostile
Josh: Just come on in man.
===

title: home_inside
---
Haze: Wow your home is so pretty!
Josh: It really isn't.
Haze: Then why are you here?
Josh: A fine question indeed.
Haze: Ha!
Haze: What's this?
Josh: That's a TV, basically shows moving images.
Haze: Well, why do you need that for? Isn't that everything already?
Josh: Real life's just not engaging enough I guess.
Haze: What?! You're weird.
Josh: I'm weird? Says the floating orange talking piece of mist who appeared out of nowhere.
Haze: Mist...
Josh: Yeah, mist. What do I even call you anyway?
Haze: Hmm. I'm not sure.
Josh: Okay then, you're Haze now.
Haze: Haze... I guess it fits.
Josh: So you have no idea how you wound up here? Really?
Haze: Nuh uh. I feel like I just woke up from a really long nap. Like, reeeeally long.
Josh: Not a nap then.
Haze: A long nap.
Josh: ...
Josh: Ugh, now what?
Haze: It grows stronger...
Josh: What?
Haze: Hm?
Josh: You just said something.
Haze: Weird, I don't remember it.
Josh: Whatever. I'm gonna watch som—
Haze: I'm gonna go for a walk!
Josh: No you're not, you'll stand out and freak out ev—hey, WAIT!
===

title: square_haze
---
Josh: HEY, wa— huff... huff... wait. Are you insane? I told you you would freak everyone out, there's already something going on, do you want people more on edge?
Haze: Relax my friend, I found something out! Look.
Haze: Ta-dah!
Josh: ...
Haze: ...
Josh: You know nothing happened right.
Haze: Well, for you it didn't, but that's because you're the only one who can see me right now.
Josh: What? I don't believe you one bit. Come back to my hou—
Villager: Josh! What are you doing just standing here?
Josh: Hum... nothing really, I was just... taking a walk. Yes, a walk.
Villager: Taking a walk? Are you insane? Can't you hear the noise coming from Elder Amos' house?
Josh: Oh, yeah. So that's where all the ruckus' coming from.
Villager: Yeah. Anyway, meet me there then, after you finish your... walk or whatever. Hurry.
Haze: Turns out you're the insane one!
Josh: Shut up.
Haze: Trust me now?
Josh: Yeah, let's go.
Haze: Let'sss.
===

title: elders_house_outside
---
Erika: Hey slowpoke.
Marcus: Joshy!
Josh: Hey guys, what happened?
Erika: Basically, elder Amos disappeared. People are saying they saw him go into the mist, speaking nonsense.
Haze: ...
Marcus: Everyone's scared, people are afraid to enter his house. Saying it's cursed.
Josh: What? No one went looking for him?
Erika: They did, but didn't go very far.
Marcus: Yeah, people are afraid, Joshy. The mist suddenly getting worse, and now this. I don't know... it's weird.
Erika: What, you believe them? You think this place is cursed?
Marcus: I'm saying it's weird, Erika, just that.
Josh: Ok, I'm going to check his place.
Erika: We'll go with you.
Haze: Tell them you'll go alone.
Josh: ...
Josh: Guys, I'd rather go alone, if you don't mind.
Erika: What? Why?
Josh: I don't know, intuition, I guess.
Marcus: That's seems not very effective, Joshy.
Erika: It seems dumb. But since it's the first time I've seen you being proactive in ages, I'll leave you to it.
Marcus: Ok then, me too. Go on.
===

title: elders_house_inside
---
Josh: Why did you tell me to come alone?
Haze: I... don't know. You said you don't want me to reveal myself.
Josh: How is that relevant here?
Haze: ...
Josh: You have something to do with all of this, don't you?
Haze: ...I don't know, really. Maybe I do.
Josh: ...
===